&lt;p&gt;# Comments: 2&lt;/p&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50554179</guid><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 00:08:35 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Show HN: Frontier Observatory – A visual timeline of what the AI labs ship</title><link>https://frontier-lab-observatory.lucentcarrot1.chatgpt.site</link><description>&lt;p&gt;Frontier labs ship a lot. This gives me a handle on things. Also nice view of what the labs are prioritising (if release/research output is any indication)..&lt;p&gt;Made with GPT-6.2 Astra High. Initial prompt was a bit rambly, some refinement over time. It suggested 'scry' which I thought was a bad name so now its called Frontier Observatory, which is a tad less terrible.&lt;p&gt;Prompt:&lt;p&gt;You know what I'd like to build.. a visuliastion studio where I can monitor the pace of output across various groups/sub-groups etc from the two predominant frontier labs racing to AGI.. I think it would make for a fascinating experience. I want the aesthetics to be out-wordly artistic, we want this to be like a portal.. a crystal bowl of making sense of the past and predicting the future..&lt;p&gt;Also need a clever name. Single word. Minimal.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
